      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This also occasionally causes hold interactions in the tools menu to fail and act as if I clicked the option instead.\n\nWhich is pretty important considering a chatbox hold menu has quick access to quickly clear a message you just wrote.\n\nBut with this bug.. it treats my action as a click causing a chatbox to open instead.. Which causes a message you might have wanted to clear sooner to instead stay up for about 3-4 extra seconds per failure, as you close a chatbox and open a menu again to attempt and do a hold interaction again..\n\nIt's inconsistent but seems to be more frequent at lower or inconsistent framerate.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
